  "body": "More Lifestyle. Less Logistics. 3 Maka Terrace tackles the family routine with ease. There's even room for the boat, the trampoline and the dogs, plus a spa pool for when you finally have five minutes to yourself at the end of the day. With the estuary and cycleway right on your doorstep, weekends include jumping on your bikes and heading over to Orewa Beach. Need coffee? The dairy? Childcare? They're all just across the road. And if you have to head to the city for work, you're less than 2km from the motorway.\r\n\r\nBuilt by Golstruct Homes and backed by the balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, this is a home that gives you the space and quality for family life, without sacrificing convenience.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* 714sqm freehold section, fully fenced and gated\r\n* Double internal-access garage plus room for the boat\r\n* Ground-floor living with easy indoor/outdoor flow\r\n* Stylish kitchen with walk-in pantry, quality appliances and gas hob\r\n* Central/ducted heating for year-round comfort\r\n* Spa pool for relaxing at the end of the day\r\n* Quality Golstruct Homes build\r\n* Balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Estuary and Te Ara Tahuna walkway/cycleway is basically on your doorstep\r\n* Dairy, cafe and childcare centre just across the road\r\n* Less than 2km to the motorway\r\n* Minutes from Orewa Beach and Silverdale Shopping Centre\r\n\r\nThis is the kind of location that makes everyday life easier. Excellent schools, shopping centres and great leisure options, it's all here. It's all near.\r\n\r\nCome and see why 3 Maka Terrace could be the family lifestyle upgrade you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/WLDR\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
